data.--reveal#--reveal:
--reveal (on show, list, codegen, paste, env show) prints the literal values for a human at a terminal.
Revealed values end up in terminal scrollback, clipboard history (paste --reveal) and generated files (codegen --reveal). Never use --reveal in CI or in a session an AI agent can read. It is refused in agent mode with exit code 2:
{"ok":false,"error":"--reveal is not allowed in agent mode"}
